{"title":"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/1/1511bddf5c72df2630fa91dba50e8097643eae4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" /> is reflected in the y-axis\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The new coordinates are\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/6/5d63c07126d31a0e7e86484a56845d6481195a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ (1, 2) \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ (-1, 2) \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ (-1, -2) \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ (1, -2) \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ (1, -1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"615\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Flipping over the y-axis would result in the x coordinate being negated. However, the y coordinate would remain the same.\n</p><p>Thus, the new coordinates would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/9/8a9cf1fbca62c9caaf2cd2017e5f626842e3d167.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } (-1, 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"102\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 